 triple product.\n\n$a\\cdot (b\\times c)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534699 true] [17592186304242 1113 #uuid "984e3979-5fe3-5ba9-8275-9fcd2e849e10" 13194139534699 true] [17592186304242 1145 "First, we find the cross product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\times c & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(0\\cdot 1-(-2)\\cdot (-2))i-((-1)\\cdot 1-0\\cdot (-2))j+((-1)\\cdot (-2)-0\\cdot 0)k \\\\  & =-4i+j+2k \\\\  & =⟨-4,1,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can compute the scalar triple product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =⟨1,2,3⟩\\cdot ⟨-4,1,2⟩ \\\\  & =1\\cdot (-4)+2\\cdot 1+3\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-4+2+6 \\\\  & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534699 true] [17592186304243 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304244 13194139534699 true] [17592186304243 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534699 true] [17592186304243 1041 "field-1" 13194139534699 true] [17592186304243 1104 #edb/ref 17592186304244 13194139534699 true] [17592186304243 1110 #uuid "0995d429-cc7b-57b6-8b79-3a213671fe6a" 13194139534699 true] [17592186304244 1034 "4" 13194139534699 true] [17592186304244 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534699 true] [17592186304244 1111 #uuid "dbeeda96-dbe4-5b72-9f65-cd85629ba459" 13194139534699 true] [17592186304245 1017 #edb/ref 17592186304246 13194139534699 true] [17592186304245 1089 "q-317303" 13194139534699 true] [17592186304245 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534699 true] [17592186304245 1100 "Find $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ given that $a=⟨-\\sqrt{8},\\,4,\\,-3⟩$ and $b\\times c=⟨\\sqrt{8},\\,-1,\\,2⟩.$\n\n$a\\cdot (b\\times c)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534699 true] [17592186304245 1113 #uuid "240e2b4d-3d29-500d-9c2c-877f809bd3bf" 13194139534699 true] [17592186304245 1145 "Substituting given vectors into the formula for the scalar triple product, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin